    "preamble": "Ao/405/2023 on 25 September, 2025 Office Notes, reports, orders or proceedings or No Date Court'S Or Judges'S Order",
    "facts": "2. On 04.09.2025, this Court directed the District Magistrate, Nainital to hold an enquiry to the effect that, despite after expiry of FSSAI License in October, 2022, packed drinking water was being manufactured and marketed by the respondent no.1. 3. In compliance of the aforesaid order, the District Magistrate constituted a Committee, comprising of S.D.M., Kaladhungi, Senior Food Safety Officer, Food Safety & Drug Administration, District Nainital, besides other officials, who conducted joint investigation, on 16.09.2025. 5. Appellant has also filed a supplementary affidavit, wherein he submitted that respondent no.1 has used the expired license for bottling and marketing the packed drinking water uptill August, 2025.",
